  [[turn left| coldPuzzleRoom W]]

:: coldPuzzleRoom E
[[turn right| coldPuzzleRoom S]]
[[turn left| coldPuzzleRoom N]]

:: coldPuzzleRoom W
[[turn right| coldPuzzleRoom N]]
[[turn left| coldPuzzleRoom S]] 

